Universal Notification System

-> Your company has an app that alerts users about account activities.
   Currently, it only sends EMails. However the product team wants to
   add SMS and Push Notifications. The System should decide which
   notification to send dynamically at runtime based on user preferences.

-> Task: Design a system where the client code doesnt need to know the
         specific class of the notification it is creating.

1. Create a common Notification interface with a send() method.
2. Implement concrete classes (EmailNotification, SMSNotification, PushNotification).
3. Create a NotificationFactory with a method that takes a string (e.g., "SMS") and
   returns the correct notification object.

NotificationFactory
 |-->  Email
 |-->  SMS
 |-->  Push

Notification
|--> Email
|--> SMS
|--> Push